Dialogue: 2,0:00:08.53,0:00:13.24,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,805)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(524,0)\c&HFDFEFE&\fscx125\fscy125}Mink Guardians
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.90,0:00:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We made it here in good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.70,0:00:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Catviper's a pretty\Nsharp navigator, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.44,0:00:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I do suppose he sailed with\Nthe King of the Pirates after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.90,0:00:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, how long should we\Nwait at these ruins anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like it's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.66,0:00:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until Master Catviper brings\NMarco here, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.18,0:00:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.09,0:00:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think he'll do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.01,0:00:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.92,0:00:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sure hope Marco comes\Nwith us to the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.72,0:00:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of Wano the Phoenix would make\Nfor a pretty powerful ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.86,0:00:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean this guy is the former first\Nedition commander of the infamous
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.64,0:00:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard Pirates so he's definitely\Nworth the effort of coming out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.12,0:00:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was surprised to find out he's\None of Master Cat Vipers friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.88,0:00:46.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this Marco's such a celebrity then\NI want to get a good look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.40,0:00:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.34,0:00:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me remind you of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.42,0:00:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master said to stay put because\Nof your intimidating looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.92,0:01:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is Marco the kind of guy who\Nwill get scared off by a face?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.26,0:01:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.66,0:01:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was referring to that quaint little\Nvillage of peace-loving folks up there,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.50,0:01:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you Karoo fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.52,0:01:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big, pearly warriors like\Nus will frighten the locals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.90,0:01:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.14,0:01:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Master Cadvipers' features are\Nscarier than mine, I would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.12,0:01:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like when he's mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.70,0:01:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but he does have a cute smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.76,0:01:22.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too true.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.56,0:01:31.28,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx110\fscy110\1c&H010101&\3c&H010101&\1a&HFF&\blur1\fad(734,731)\t(692,734,\1a&H00&)\t(5989,6031,\1a&HFF&)}Onward to Wano
Dialogue: 2,0:01:24.56,0:01:31.28,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx110\fscy110\bord0\c&HE6E6E6&\blur1\fad(734,731)}Onward to Wano
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.52,0:01:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There! Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.26,0:02:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, he's all fixed up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.52,0:02:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.46,0:02:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said you're all better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.30,0:02:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tama, feel good?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.56,0:02:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't push yourself too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.66,0:02:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The flames of restoration only\Nhave a slight effect on others.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.00,0:02:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since I patched you up your natural\Nhealing speed will be faster now.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.50,0:02:31.76,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,655)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(521,0)\t(479,521,\1a&H00&)\fscx110\fscy110\c&H010101&\3c&H010101&\bord2.5}Marco\NFormer 1st Division Commander (Ship's Doctor)\NWhitebeard Pirates
Dialogue: 2,0:02:25.50,0:02:31.76,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,655)\bord0\blur0.8\fad(521,0)\c&HFCFDFC&\fscx110\fscy110}Marco\NFormer 1st Division Commander (Ship's Doctor)\NWhitebeard Pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.12,0:02:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be bouncing around by tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.54,0:02:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels like you're back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.76,0:02:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.10,0:03:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.04,0:03:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Set by tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.00,0:03:05.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the help, Marco!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.12,0:03:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.66,0:03:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marco? Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.26,0:03:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a knot in my shoulder.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.51,0:03:19.22,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,715)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(270,0)\t(228,270,\1a&H00&)\fscx110\fscy110\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}Nekomamushi\NMink Guardians
Dialogue: 2,0:03:16.51,0:03:19.22,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,715)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(270,0)\c&HFAFAFA&\fscx110\fscy110}Nekomamushi\NMink Guardians
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.76,0:03:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marco, I saw a knot through the mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.46,0:03:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marco, the vest was an ideal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.82,0:03:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you use some tears?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.12,0:03:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marco, I slipped a disc in my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.20,0:03:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.14,0:03:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll help you all, but\None at a time now, please
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.74,0:03:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pops built this village, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.88,0:03:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he took care of the people here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.14,0:04:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you got, I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.34,0:04:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Countries that are too poor to pay\Nheavenly tribute to the Celestial
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.42,0:04:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dragons are not allowed to join\Nthe world government at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.48,0:04:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They tend to be lawless lands where\Npirates and kidnappers run amok.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.96,0:04:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no one to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.78,0:04:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when the country succumbs to collapse,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.16,0:04:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it turns out a fresh\Ngeneration of orphans.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.52,0:04:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pops was one of those kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.10,0:04:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With nothing left to lose, he\Nwent out to sea at an early age.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.38,0:04:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even after becoming a pirate,\Nhe cared about this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.84,0:04:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd funneled dirty money and\Nsupplies here whenever he could,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.02,0:04:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he never revealed who he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.54,0:04:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did it till he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.30,0:04:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He never had a family, and his\Nfriends were all long gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.08,0:04:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this island was always home to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.50,0:05:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a corrupt world, there's no\Nsuch thing as clean or dirty money.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.50,0:05:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just money.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.48,0:05:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice of you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.80,0:05:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So after the war in Marineford,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.26,0:05:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at the very least we wanted to protect\Nthis village that Pops loved so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.22,0:05:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why we started\Na grudge war with Teach
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.68,0:05:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when he tried to invade\Nour territory and claim it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.94,0:05:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we were no match for Teach,\Nespecially after he stole Pops' power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.16,0:05:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end, he took everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.58,0:05:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted him to pay, and\NI wanted to do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.64,0:05:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.78,0:05:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.90,0:05:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was kind of a cheapskate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.78,0:06:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd always mooch drinks off of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.96,0:06:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the guy never once\Noffered to cover our tap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.88,0:06:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And nobody said a thing\Nbecause we all knew
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.32,0:06:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what he was doing with the money he saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.64,0:06:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was sending it to the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.28,0:06:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, ain't that something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.64,0:06:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that makes this peaceful little spot\Nthe last memento that he left behind,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.46,0:06:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.54,0:06:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.22,0:06:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.48,0:06:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Red-haired Shanks made\Nsure to bury him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.68,0:06:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, have you heard\Nof a warlord named Weevil?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.92,0:06:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said he's Pops' biological son,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.30,0:06:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now he's attacking people\Nconnected to Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.58,0:06:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, is her claim true?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.68,0:07:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.42,0:07:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never knew his taste in women.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.38,0:07:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I had to guess,\Nthey're after his fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.06,0:07:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I doubt they'd believe us\Nif we said there wasn't one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.98,0:07:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.26,0:07:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.17,0:07:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time\Nbefore they come for this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.92,0:07:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see. That means you got us stuck here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.52,0:07:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weevil's mother buckin was a\Npirate back in her younger days
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.14,0:07:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I recall correctly, it must\Nhave been about 30 or 40 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.00,0:07:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I even heard she used to be\Non the very same ship as pops
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.96,0:07:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And maybe you gotta have another\Nmemento of his to protect
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.88,0:07:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not sure about that,\Nconsidering his behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.82,0:07:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A fine pint!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.72,0:07:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're going to see Straw Hat Luffy\Nafter this, can you pass on a message?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.52,0:07:55.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing big.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.00,0:07:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:08:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you're going to Wano? Yep.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.63,0:08:06.01,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,805)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(519,0)\t(478,519,\1a&H00&)\c&H040404&\3c&H040404&\bord2.5\fscx125\fscy125}At Sea\NNew World
Dialogue: 2,0:08:02.63,0:08:06.01,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,805)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(519,0)\c&HFDFEFE&\fscx125\fscy125}At Sea\NNew World
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.82,0:08:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, it says the referee kicked off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.18,0:08:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Royalty from all over are attending.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.26,0:08:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're at the conference\Nin Marie Joie right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.36,0:08:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All eyes are on a set\Nof guests who haven't
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.72,0:08:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Participated in two centuries\Nthrough a Ryugu kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.34,0:08:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,King Neptune will be in\Nattendance with all his children.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.64,0:08:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.55,0:08:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like Shirahoshi was\Na big hit with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.94,0:08:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means she went up\Nto the surface, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.46,0:08:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's getting tougher.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.90,0:08:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm proud of her.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.66,0:08:43.42,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(1458,670)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(525,0)\t(484,525,\1a&H00&)\fscx110\fscy110\c&H010101&\3c&H010101&\bord2.5}Captain "Straw Hat" Luffy\N{\fscx100\fscy100}Straw Hat Pirates\NBounty: {\fnImpress BT Pace}¬{\fnKakumin Web}1.5 Billion
Dialogue: 2,0:08:38.66,0:08:43.42,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(1458,670)\bord0\blur0.8\fad(525,0)\c&HFCFDFC&\fscx110\fscy110}Captain "Straw Hat" Luffy\N{\fscx100\fscy100}Straw Hat Pirates\NBounty: {\fnImpress BT Pace}¬{\fnKakumin Web}1.5 Billion
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.34,0:08:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says here that your grandpa\Nwas their personal escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.40,0:08:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like they're making arrangements\Nto relocate fishmen to the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.38,0:08:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their dream's coming true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.68,0:08:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.14,0:08:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi, my sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.38,0:08:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're even more\Nbeautiful than I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.02,0:09:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want to smooch ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.10,0:09:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.01,0:09:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want another?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.40,0:09:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, do I get some change back?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.34,0:09:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me get in close.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.70,0:09:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.76,0:09:13.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.67,0:09:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.96,0:09:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.50,0:09:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.76,0:09:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She looks so elegant and formal now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.58,0:09:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I hope I get to meet her someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.56,0:09:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think Vivi might be\Ninterested in your mere panties?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.86,0:09:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.74,0:09:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, these are photos\Nof the Mingling Plaza.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.66,0:09:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at all the royal families.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.48,0:09:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tons of bodyguards, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.88,0:09:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People from Dressrosa should\Nbe there as well, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.88,0:09:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There she is, Viola!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.60,0:09:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh! Wapol!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.26,0:09:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, an acorn guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.44,0:09:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Waffle?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.06,0:09:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is he there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.36,0:10:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Rebecca and Sai!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.36,0:10:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know a lot of these guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.58,0:10:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.52,0:10:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I suppose any royalty we\Nknow would be at the reverie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.10,0:10:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's kind of the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.24,0:10:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.88,0:10:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then just maybe all the\Nprincesses I've ever
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.80,0:10:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,met are in this same\Nplace at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.34,0:10:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet they're all getting\Nexcited talking about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.60,0:10:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You keep thinking that, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.40,0:10:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, look. Did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.40,0:10:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.18,0:10:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chill, bro. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.00,0:10:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Doctorine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.74,0:10:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, the old bag's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.30,0:10:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr. Reed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.26,0:11:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't cut up the paper!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.46,0:11:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to save it, Chopper! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.44,0:11:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me the section with the princesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.40,0:11:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you two doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.54,0:11:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You morons!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.86,0:11:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't finished reading it yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.58,0:11:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all full of holes now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.28,0:11:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, an article about Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.60,0:11:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Big Mom 2?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.00,0:11:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.26,0:11:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, Chopper, give me\Nthose pages back! Nuh-uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.28,0:11:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad to hear everyone's doing so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.12,0:11:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once we're done sailing around\Nthe world, let's go see them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that sounds like a novel idea to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.38,0:11:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, back to getting things in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.60,0:11:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you tried to see if the\Ntransponder snail can connect yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.66,0:11:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.46,0:11:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, this is Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.70,0:11:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is anyone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.08,0:11:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.26,0:11:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody picked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.84,0:12:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget it. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.44,0:12:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.86,0:12:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.20,0:12:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feel that wind?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.42,0:12:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be a good sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.52,0:12:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen waves like those.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.04,0:12:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the wind here is freezing cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.50,0:12:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I think this is the sea around Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.32,0:12:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you all feel how the wind keeps\Ngetting stronger the closer we get?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.16,0:12:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the waves only grow taller.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.70,0:13:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take notice of how it's spinning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.74,0:13:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not just from the wind currents.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.28,0:13:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a very unusual flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.46,0:13:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.37,0:13:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See how it's picking up over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.30,0:13:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe we should avoid the storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.64,0:13:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe buy ourselves a little time?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.70,0:13:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Brooke?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.50,0:13:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about that junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.00,0:13:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.12,0:13:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Luffy, why would you deliberately put\Nyour crew in such a dangerous situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.82,0:13:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.94,0:13:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.12,0:13:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we left, Kin'emon did\Ngive me a heads-up about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.26,0:13:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll explain it on the\Nauditory snail apparatus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.30,0:13:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you approach the land of Wano, you'll\Nfind the entrance to be quite perilous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.06,0:13:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weather grueling, the\Ntides violently churning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.80,0:13:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a difficult country to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.30,0:13:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.24,0:14:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weather is always this awful?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.38,0:14:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose we have no other\Nchoice if that's the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.30,0:14:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's why we should just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.82,0:14:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's Samurai warriors are mighty,\Nplus it's this hard to get into?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.02,0:14:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wonder it's such an isolated country.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.68,0:14:13.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.59,0:14:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me think this over a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.94,0:14:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There has to be some way\Nto get us in there safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.06,0:14:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.08,0:14:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that thing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.58,0:14:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an octopus!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.12,0:14:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy's big!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.60,0:14:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it on the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.18,0:14:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because we're at sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.44,0:14:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I realized that, Carrot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.46,0:14:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on board!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.40,0:14:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, while you're over there bickering,\Nthose waters are pulling us in!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.72,0:14:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.92,0:14:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Sunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.36,0:14:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the Land of Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.84,0:15:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it looks like\Nsomething's coming towards us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.52,0:15:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, what is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.28,0:15:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It kind of looks like a giant fish to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.74,0:15:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it a shark? Please, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.46,0:15:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Viggettus!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.46,0:15:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koi fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.06,0:15:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.08,0:15:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.66,0:15:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.44,0:15:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A whole school of koi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.52,0:15:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are those\Nthings doing in the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.36,0:15:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're freshwater fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.88,0:15:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can they survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.24,0:15:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.30,0:16:00.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're monsters anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.24,0:16:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji! Do these things fry up okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.84,0:16:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That stuff's not important right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.78,0:16:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it's possible if you wash them\Nin hot water and then serve them chilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.10,0:16:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can make our eye or I\Ncan simmer them in some Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.46,0:16:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can batter them up and make tempura\Nor simmer them in sweet sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.22,0:16:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once we find the rest of the crew,\Nlet's celebrate with one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.60,0:16:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't struggle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.38,0:16:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it's gonna struggle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.90,0:16:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think it's gonna just let you eat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.18,0:16:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Sanji,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.26,0:16:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're the one who put this dumb idea\Nin his head, so you go bring him back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.90,0:16:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that big a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.60,0:16:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know he can manage on his own. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.62,0:16:56.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just worry about\Nprotecting the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.20,0:17:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wind is picking up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.94,0:17:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Carrot, probe a tail! On it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.56,0:17:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need help!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.90,0:17:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crazy look, how clear the water is?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.16,0:17:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's crystal clear,\Nlike a mountain stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.48,0:17:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.98,0:17:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.00,0:17:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The giant fish are freaking me\Nout—is this a river? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.94,0:17:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like they're all\Nheaded to the same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.46,0:18:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on tight—we're just\Nalong for the ride now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.52,0:18:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ride now
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.06,0:18:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's movies on the road!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.32,0:18:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.92,0:18:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.80,0:18:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The river's flowing into the waterfall,\Nnot away from it, like usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.60,0:18:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.46,0:18:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be a massive freshwater\Nsource at the top of the falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.14,0:18:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why it's not seawater.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.82,0:18:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder, could that be 1-0 up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.18,0:18:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.48,0:18:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of this makes any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.30,0:18:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm scared! It's terrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.26,0:19:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.56,0:19:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fish are climbing\Nthe waterfall! They are!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.64,0:19:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go Koi Fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.98,0:19:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go Koi Fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.68,0:19:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how we can\Nget the Sunny up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.38,0:19:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll think if we take it head on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.12,0:19:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open to suggestions right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.42,0:19:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.18,0:19:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.90,0:19:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those koi are tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.30,0:19:42.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can admire the fish later!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.32,0:19:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, the ship's going to sink!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.74,0:19:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, I got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.60,0:19:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.84,0:19:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should probably hang on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.76,0:19:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave the way, fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.00,0:20:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.12,0:20:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.24,0:20:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.12,0:20:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're doing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.80,0:20:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm starting to think\NWano isn't going to be very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.78,0:20:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of this chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.66,0:21:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, that's the shore over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.00,0:21:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.32,0:21:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loopy, let go of the fish! No, never!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.54,0:21:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're my dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.14,0:21:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.66,0:21:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ross, take the helm!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.76,0:21:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's your wish, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.60,0:21:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No use!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.94,0:21:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The current's way too strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.92,0:21:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.14,0:21:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we were almost there, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.76,0:21:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was nice telling you!\NDr. Vegapunk! I need it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.22,0:22:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's my koi?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.94,0:22:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're already floofy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.78,0:22:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.66,0:22:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're getting flushed!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.80,0:22:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
